'  Layout hints  (hidden arrows force horizontal placement)
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
AuditlogDirectory -[hidden]right-> AuditLogDomain
AuditLogDomain -[hidden]right-> AuditlogApplicationService
AuditlogApplicationService -[hidden]right-> AuditlogRepositoryAdapter
Severity -[hidden]right-> AuditlogDirectory

