CreateAuditlogCmd ..> Severity : uses
AuditlogResponse ..> ActorType : uses
AuditlogResponse ..> Severity : uses
Log ..> ActorType : uses
Log ..> Severity : uses

' DomainId implemented by value objects (shared-kernel)
LogId ..|> DomainId : implements



